WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.770
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.520
<i>I remember...</i>

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:36.130
<i>everything.</i>

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:42.310
<i>Everything about the modern day and myself.</i>

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:49.630
<i>My home is a small antique shop.</i>

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.940
<i>I live there among the antiques.</i>

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.370
<i>And I had lots of friends 
to keep me company.</i>

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.230
Mei-chan, what are you doing?

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:02.170
Playing with blocks!

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:03.880
That looks hard.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:05.730
It's really easy. Look!

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:07.180
Huh?

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:10.320
You're so funny, Mei-chan.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:16.260
<i>Now that I think about it, 
those friends were ghosts.</i>

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:21.270
<i>But that was all normal to me.</i>

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.990
Did you know? Apparently, that girl
 can see ghosts.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.750
Whoa, really?

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:30.030
<i>That was when I realized it was just me.</i>

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.540
<i>I couldn't stand being so different.</i>

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:36.100
<i>So, I covered my ears</i>

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:40.550
<i>and stopped interacting with 
both humans and ghosts.</i>

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.040
<i>But, still, sometimes...</i>

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:46.060
Mei-chan, Mei-chan!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.050
<i>A voice would keep calling out to me,</i>

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:51.060
<i>and I blocked that voice out as well.</i>

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:01.590
<i>It was so much easier not to 
interact with anyone or anything.</i>

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.490
<i>I was more at peace by myself.</i>

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:06.870
<i>But...</i>

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.900
You're Ayazuki Mei-san, right?

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:11.070
Do you wanna come with us?

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:17.380
<i>When that girl invited me to go with them...</i>

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.850
Oh, I'll have to pass.

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:19.810
Y-You sure?

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:20.960
Forget about her.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.320
She's always by herself.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:23.140
Really?

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.240
She seems to like it that way.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.100
Really?

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.640
She's been able to hear ghosts
talking since we were kids.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:31.050
<i>I'm sure that this time... this time...</i>

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:37.770
<i>Then I was sent back into Meiji-era Tokyo</i>

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:41.730
<i>by Charlie-san's magic.</i>

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.170
<i>And I met Ougai-san.</i>

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:54.040
<i>Coming here changed me into 
someone totally different.</i>

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.800
<i>No, that's not exactly right.</i>

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:04.130
<i>I've come to realize that 
this is the real me.</i>

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.050
<i>Which is why I'm sure...</i>

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.170
You're Ayazuki Mei-san, right?

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:11.340
Do you wanna come with us?

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:15.040
<i>I could respond to her 
very differently now.</i>

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:17.980
<i>With the way I am now...</i>

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.580
Mei-chan.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:21.730
Huh?

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:24.070
Mei-chan, it's me.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.310
Charlie-san?

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:27.850
Yep, that's right.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.880
Huh? But this voice...

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:35.430
You've changed quite a bit since 
coming to this time, Mei-chan.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:37.890
You've been able to smile more.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.700
You've learned to shed tears for others

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:46.340
and learned to face what's 
ahead with all your strength.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.470
I am so glad.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:53.120
Getting to see you grow like this
has truly made me glad.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:58.220
Tomorrow is the full moon, Mei-chan.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:03.480
I was so happy when you said you wanted

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.980
to stay here forever.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.740
Umm... Charlie-san.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:13.630
I...

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:18.380
Mei-san, are you there?

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.880
Fumi-san?

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:23.120
Forgive me, but Ougai-san 
is calling for you.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.420
Ougai-san is?

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.180
All right, I'll be right there.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:36.140
<b>Embraced by the Strawberry Moon</b>

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:44.140
<i>Ougai-san is in a really good mood.</i>

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.400
Behold!

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:51.900
Uwah, it's finished?

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.820
Yes. What do you think?

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.870
The whole form is also ideal.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.910
It was completed with true craftsmanship.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.000
It matches the design right 
down to the details.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.130
The color has also been 
splendidly recreated.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.680
It's wonderful.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.630
The golden color really shines.

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:10.630
I will finally be able to present my Little 
Squirrel while she's wearing this tomorrow night.

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.880
I'm so excited! Ah, so very excited.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.930
It's so beautiful.

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:37.320
It will look lovely on you.

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:44.870
I'm so happy,

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:46.920
Ougai-san.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.640
He's crying!

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.430
Ougai-san.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.430
What is it?

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:04.970
May I wear it now?

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.910
Of course you may!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:15.370
I would love seeing you in 
it as soon as possible!

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:17.860
Fumi-san, please assist 
her with getting changed.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:19.670
Please help me, Fumi-san.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:21.150
All right.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:24.020
Now then, Mei-san. Come with me.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:24.860
Okay.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.190
How incredible.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.870
You shine so brightly, Mei.

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.210
My fiancée.

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:02.310
May I have this dance?

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.200
You may.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:38.560
You are dancing so gracefully, Mei.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:42.220
Thanks to you, Ougai-san.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:56.630
Mei,

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:01.550
I look forward to tomorrow's party.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:18.270
Mei, we are going to go on 
ahead to the Rokumeikan.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:22.760
I have to greet our host, 
Minister of Foreign Affairs Inoue.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.550
I have arranged a carriage 
to take you separately,

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:29.270
so you can take that to the 
party once you are ready.

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:31.550
All right, thank you.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:51.920
Thank you...

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:13.350
Hey, Mori-san. I heard you will be 
presenting your fiancée here this evening,

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.720
but I don't see the princess in question.

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:22.370
A princess makes her appearance
fashionably late. Right, Mori-san?

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:25.870
I am very much looking forward to 
seeing Mei-san at the party tonight.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.890
I have not seen her since the banquet.

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:30.110
Please don't bring up that day.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.790
She is going to be arriving a bit late.

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:37.770
But to think my Little Squirrel has 
inspired such feelings in all of you...

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:40.620
My fiancée is certainly loved.

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:43.980
Ougai-san.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:46.620
She's here.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.160
Oh, Mei-san!

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:25.280
The first time I met you 
was here at the Rokumeikan,

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:29.480
and you were wearing that same skirt!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.720
I am impressed, Mei-san.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:34.970
By all means, shall we dance?

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:42.560
Ougai-san?

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.550
Ougai-san!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:48.470
Wait.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:53.110
What is it?

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:02.920
Mei-san, I might have been tormented

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:07.960
by eternal darkness and regret 
had it not been for you.

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:11.010
Thank you so much, my fairy.

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:15.510
Yakumo-san, I hope you will 
always be close with Jane-san.

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.340
Of course I will.

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:20.670
My relationship with her was 
repaired thanks to you.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.050
Mei-san.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.040
Tosuke-san.

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:30.540
I will be sure to make the 
future you saw a reality.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:35.110
I know you will. I fully 
believe that you can do it.

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:36.710
Mei.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.530
You've become such a fine lady,
I might not have recognized you.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.550
Otojiro-san.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:46.880
Now, now. What are you crying for,
 you silly girl?

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:50.210
A woman's tears are more 
valuable than diamonds.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:52.640
You mustn't let them fall so easily.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:56.600
K-Kyoka-san!

00:13:56.930 --> 00:14:00.370
You dummy, what're you doing? Come on.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.440
D-Don't get the wrong idea.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.730
I will make sure to sanitize myself later.

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:09.320
Don't think for one second that I'm 
happy to be dancing with you, though.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:12.480
Okay.

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:16.820
Fujita-san.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:21.210
Girl, just keep looking ahead.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:22.580
Huh?

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:25.910
Girl...

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:31.370
Take care of yourself.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.610
Syunso-san.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:59.340
There were so many times 
that I hoped your memories

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:01.420
would never come back.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:10.290
I had hoped the days when you would 
always be here would go on forever.

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:13.780
But I knew.

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:18.500
That you had a place you chose to be,

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:23.340
and that you would have 
to go back there someday.

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:30.310
I'm sure Ougai-san feels the same.

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:40.150
Ougai-san is in the park.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:45.130
The place where we first met you.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:48.660
Go there.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:54.920
I will.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.490
Goodbye...

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.660
<i>This is where we met that day,</i>

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:32.390
<i>but everything looks different to me now.</i>

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:36.430
<i>That's...</i>

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:51.440
Mei, you remember everything now, don't you?

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:52.980
I do.

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:56.280
That also made me remember

00:16:56.280 --> 00:17:00.030
that there are still some 
things I need to do there.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:01.970
And I...

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:07.840
And I have to see them through.

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:20.700
Ougai-san...

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.490
You must go, then.

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:30.950
Go ahead and finish those
things, Little Squirrel.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.300
Ougai-san...

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.510
You will be able to do those things now.

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:42.750
You are no longer a little squirrel

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:45.970
shivering with fright, like when we first met.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:47.570
Ougai-san.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:53.290
Now you are my darling, 
darling, Little Squirrel.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.090
I was able...

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:03.410
to truly be myself because you were here.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.630
Because my beloved Ougai-san was here.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:12.750
I love you, Ougai-san.

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:15.060
I love you too,

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.190
Little Squirrel.

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:23.120
You will always be my 
precious Little Squirrel.

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:29.990
Go on now.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.270
Okay.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.190
I'll be going.

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:21.850
So you've made your decision, Mei-chan.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:22.950
Yes.

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:28.840
I will go back to my time, Charlie-san.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:32.680
All right, then.

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:36.430
Mei-chan, you have such 
a wonderful expression.

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:39.240
It's very charming.

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:48.110
I was always being protected 
by a voice, your voice.

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:49.360
Three!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.620
Thank you, Charlie-san.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:52.930
Two!

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:54.140
Thank you.

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:56.000
One!

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:17.800
This is the finale of my magic.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:19.950
Mei-chan,

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:26.880
<i>please find happiness!</i>

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:52.140
<b>Mori Ougai Anthology</b>

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:12.710
So, have you heard about that café  
they introduced on TV yesterday?

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:15.080
Oh, I saw that. It's near here, isn't it?

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:17.150
Their desserts should be 
half-price right now.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:18.290
Why don't we go check it out?

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.230
I'll totally go.

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:20.550
I definitely want to go!

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:23.060
You're Ayazuki Mei-san, right?

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:24.550
Do you wanna come with us?

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.760
Desserts? Half-price? I'd love to go!

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:33.200
I love desserts!

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:34.670
Right? I thought you might.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:36.240
It's the one that was 
on TV yesterday, right?

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:38.020
Yeah! It has this huge ghost parfait!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:38.850
A ghost parfait?!

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:40.820
It's got fruit and the whipped 
cream is shaped like a ghost.

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.390
They say it's so light that when you eat it,

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:44.300
it'll disappear in your mouth like a ghost.

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:45.660
So that's why they call it that!

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:48.320
Is it true that you can 
hear ghosts, Ayazuki-san?

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.410
It's true, they're my friends.

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:51.570
That's so cool!

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:52.440
Aren't you scared of them?

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:58.630
Ougai-san.

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:04.340
Do you think we'll ever see her again?

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.640
Of course we will.

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:13.180
We must have faith in that.

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:20.460
Hey, Mori-san!

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:21.740
Hey!

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:21.550
Mori-san!

00:22:21.550 --> 00:22:22.470
You're being a nuisance.

00:22:22.470 --> 00:22:24.020
We brought alcohol!

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:26.860
I even brought some Japanese sake.

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:29.530
Koizumi! How dare you bring 
sake from someone else's home!

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:31.230
We thought you two might be feeling lonely.

00:22:31.230 --> 00:22:34.160
And I just happened to run into everyone.

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:33.690
Why do I have to tag along with you idiots?

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:35.060
Come on, let's have a drink!

00:22:35.060 --> 00:22:37.200
Looks like it's going to be rather 
lively around here again.
